            <div xml:id="d918">

                <pb facs="0830" n="714" xml:id="pg714"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/15230.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Brazilian Minister to
                            Mexico to the Secretary of State ad
                            interim</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Brazilian Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico City</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-06-16T12:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 16, 1915—noon</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>645. Your 777, June 15, 3 p.m., and 779, June 15, 6 p.m. I have just complied
                    with both requests. Cooperation of principal colleagues already in active work
                    and I think all the others will help. They think peaceful settlement greatly
                    depends upon calm discussion between factions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cardoso de Oliveira.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
